  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Greetings, \nIn the past few weeks, I keep experiencing a bug where the world I am attempting to access is downloading/loading and hangs at less than 100%, doesn't resume, and I am forced to go back to my default home world and try again. \nIf I try again and again, I eventually seem to succeed, but many of these worlds I'm trying to join are private and by invitation and often for a particular event at a particular time, that I am often helping to run, so this seemingly insignificant bug does in fact cause huge headaches to others in requesting the same invitation over and over again while they are busy attending to more important matters, plus I am delayed in joining events that I'm hosting.\nI've logged off and logged on, installed all updates, rebooted the headset, etc. all to no avail. My next steps were going to be deleting and reinstalling VR Chat and even resetting the headset back to factory specs. Any other suggestions? Anybody else reported this? Can't find a similar ticket. \nThanks for your help,\nChris",
